  "contentHtml": "<p>베게너가 첫번째 세계지도를 갖고 있었다면 대륙이동설이 탄생했을까요?&#160;</p><p>첫번째 지도는 아시아 중심의 지도라고 합니다. 두번째 지도는 유럽 중심의 지도이구요.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/80e574df277d7c748eaa0bd77bc296718f5d283a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/80e574df277d7c748eaa0bd77bc296718f5d283a\" data-origin-width=\"725\" data-origin-height=\"496\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/163351d5ae9c5788fb3dcec9ccda6f54dbe8001c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/163351d5ae9c5788fb3dcec9ccda6f54dbe8001c\" data-origin-width=\"1179\" data-origin-height=\"686\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
